<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico weekly livestock export data -USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico weekly livestock export data -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to May 19.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		312	    46,303     26,275</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	  27	     1,075	  587</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	29	     2,302	  663</p>
<p>Total			  368	    49,680     27,525</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0		 410     31,831</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0		 287	  140</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     3,769	  846</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	   0		 107	   26</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females	18	    11,712	5,427</p>
<p>Total			   18	    11,819	5,453</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
